# Python packages prefetched into the session image (emacs.md section 9):
# their wheels go to /opt/playground/prefetch/wheels, which uv reads as a
# find-links directory, so `uv add numpy` and `uv sync` work offline.
#
# To offer another package: add it here, regenerate python.txt (the
# command is at the top of that file), rebuild the image.
numpy
pytest
